d or bankrupt names) are left out \u2014 a mild survivorship effect, reported here as the count of missing price histories.","Next-month returns are measured close to close at month-end; real trading after the signal adds slippage beyond the 10 bp per unit of turnover charged.","Short positions also pay borrow (shown per name from IBKR's stock-loan file) \u2014 not deducted from the backtest.","This is research, not a recommendation: size and approve positions through the fund's own process."]},"proof":{"rows":[{"id":"sm_quant_adds","kind":"strategy","name":"Follow the quant giants' buying","family":"13F institutions","cagr":0.1795,"sharpe":0.81,"max_drawdown":-0.3303,"alpha":0.0382,"alpha_t":1.83,"r2":0.873,"equity_beta":1.008,"capm_alpha":0.03529751632992284,"capm_t":1.3759362708484681,"capm_beta":1.0548494418633434,"deflated_sharpe":0.8328127769965964,"pbo":null,"cpcv_positive":null,"evaluated_at":"2026-10-27 14:20","verdict":"promising","verdict_text":"Positive alpha but not yet statistically proven \u2014 candidate for a small, monitored allocation.","note":null},{"id":"sm_rentech","kind":"strategy","name":"Renaissance disclosed holdings clone","family":"13F institutions","cagr":0.168,"sharpe":0.789,"max_drawdown":-0.3141,"alpha":0.0368,"alpha_t":1.38,"r2":0.778,"equity_beta":1.093,"capm_alpha":0.0394745827291394,"capm_t":1.3065579306324113,"capm_beta":0.943584119076207,"deflated_sharpe":0.820416787523291,"pbo":null,"cpcv_positive":null,"evaluated_at":"2026-10-27 14:18","verdict":"promising","verdict_text":"Positive alpha but not yet statistically proven \u2014 candidate for a small, monitored allocation.","note":null},{"id":"vrp_timing","kind":"strategy","name":"Volatility risk premium timing","family":"Defensive","cagr":0.1467,"sharpe":0.914,"max_drawdown":-0.24,"alpha":0.0244,"alpha_t":1.21,"r2":0.722,"equity_beta":0.954,"capm_alpha":0.049918172906605954,"capm_t":2.2324121096438794,"capm_beta":0.6644598250351916,"deflated_sharpe":0.9424908592478732,"pbo":0.1